@model string
@* CASE-047 B04: where a Glass's launch, resume or return answers when it is
   not the estimator itself. The provider runs in its own window opened from
   the Case record, so the answer is a hand-back rather than a page: the Case
   window is sent to its Estimate section, where the outcome is reported, and
   this window closes. Without script, or without an opener, this window goes
   there itself. The model is the Estimate section's own address. *@
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0;url=@Model" />
    <title>Pegasus</title>
</head>
<body data-glass-return="@Model">
    <script src="~/js/glass-return.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
</body>
</html>
